    "document": "Event Companion",
    "section": "Teams Event Companion",
    "summary": "Both teams privately nominate a Defender, then disclose their picks together. Each secretly nominates two other teammates to challenge the other side’s Defender. Reveal both pairs of nominees at once. Each team then privately picks an opposing nominee for its own Defender. Reveal both decisions together to lock in two games. The Defenders then announce their chosen layouts. Each Primary Mission combination offers three recommended layouts, A through C, listed in the app and the Singles companion.",
